"distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling": "裁剪",
"distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.overdrawPrevention": "过绘制预防",
"distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.overdrawPrevention.@tooltip": "如果启用，DH 将尝试防止过绘制。\n\n过绘制是指同一个像素被多次绘制，\n这会降低性能。",
